    Section 5 for details). The button press logic here is DIFFERENT 
    from Flappy Bird - it specifically checks for the TRANSITION from 
    "not pressed" to "pressed" (a rising edge), rather than continuously 
    reading the button state every frame. If your button wiring reads 
    LOW when pressed instead of HIGH, adjust the comparisons accordingly 
    throughout updateGame().

