8. CUSTOMIZATION GUIDE
================================================================================

WANT TO...                          | CHANGE THIS VARIABLE/VALUE
-------------------------------------|------------------------------------------
Make the bar move slower/faster      | barSpeed = 2  ->  try 1 (slower/easier) 
                                      | or 4 (faster/harder)
Start with a wider/easier zone       | zoneWidth = 25  ->  try 35 or 40
Change minimum zone size             | if (zoneWidth > 10)  ->  change 10 to 
                                      | a different minimum floor value
Change difficulty ramp-up rate       | if (streak % 5 == 0)  ->  change 5 to 
                                      | 10 for slower difficulty progression
Give more/fewer lives                | lives = 3  ->  change in BOTH the 
                                      | global variable default AND inside 
                                      | resetGame()
Change result display duration       | millis() - resultTime > 800  ->  
                                      | change 800 to a different millisecond 
                                      | value (e.g., 500 for faster pacing)
Change scoring formula               | points = max(1, 10 - distFromCenter)  
                                      | -> adjust the base value (10) or 
                                      | minimum guaranteed points (1)
Change starting zone position range  | random(20, 128 - zoneWidth - 20)  ->  
                                      | adjust the margin values (20) to 
                                      | allow zone closer to screen edges

